{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b92b44118f460d2d44ee02b786ced2139f61c5e6a4925c32b705a05b11e12c24", "ja": "（響達のライブの片付けが終わって事務室に戻ると、\nデスクに見覚えのない手紙が置いてあった）", "zh": "（等响她们的演唱会清场完，回到事务室时，\n办公桌上多了一封没见过的信。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "34902958d6f1e43a388b5fa6c0a1e0e877fa2f362d00f6e18ff441c9118781b4", "ja": "（中には『屋上で待つ！』とだけ書いてあったけど、\nこれはいったい……）", "zh": "（信中只写着『顶楼见！』，\n到底是怎么回事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "fa8e01485f256834cb9f56828680a7a7258f4471a4d2607897e04db8c96fd489", "ja": "ふっふっふ、よく来たね。", "zh": "哼哼哼，你来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "49e21a6547e044a10b23f47c96381f7e1ef5ed4978bea053342d260f93512f28", "ja": "あっ、響。ということは、\nあの手紙の送り主も……？", "zh": "啊，响，也就是说，\n那封信是你放的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "c59aba46125ccc32ee61a41a1106c1b738ac47d5fc9df0fa714ea5a790288e6c", "ja": "そう！　あれは自分からの果たし状だぞっ！　\n{$P$}、自分と勝負だっ！", "zh": "没错！那封信是本人下的挑战书喔！\n{$P$}，跟本人一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a9d6d8d194520c2ff5331d140f581c63c05de27ccdc61002c06e7e4a100e871d", "ja": "し、勝負？　どうしてまた？", "zh": "一、一决胜负？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "3000c37f8124cf87ef04cd9510ca438274e1f45a27ce5dfb746f061197406ce3", "ja": "どうしてって……。この間、海で自分にしたこと\n忘れたとは言わせないぞ！", "zh": "你还敢问……\n可别说你忘了上次在海边对本人做过的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a7becc4ebb9a8ea71528d1d5856a324d4264633cef753ec79864431fa971ff9e", "ja": "ごめん、忘れたと思う。", "zh": "抱歉，我应该是忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "1204af1879d28c19fed68d5b621f51b0ea4bc2ee536336530b432bd8892599cd", "ja": "うぎゃあああっ、ヒドすぎるぞ～！\n自分のこと、からかって笑ったでしょ！？", "zh": "呜呀──你太过分了～！\n你那时候不是捉弄本人，还嘲笑本人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "38c759933eeb06185449753d6183223ea9a275b27c31482a9efaac4ece4b08fc", "ja": "響をからかって……？", "zh": "我捉弄你……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3ca66bc129e4fb036caa2cf54e52e0ee2067d6936ea8e609d07557cc9171d50c", "ja": "あ、海で響の服を褒めた時のことか？\nいや、あれは別にからかったワケじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，是说我在海边称赞你的服装时的事吗？\n不是，我那并不是在捉弄你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "d6c5811e029b74f7a1a44ea991ea2ebe2ef71678f6924f13c3f3fd25eec94e0b", "ja": "うう、思い出したら、またくやしくなってきたぞ……。\nとにかく勝負だ！　自分にリベンジさせてよ～！", "zh": "呜呜，一回想起来，本人又开始觉得不甘心……\n不管怎样，一决胜负吧！让本人雪耻啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "256bedff6e0d7d04c6610b855f6ee58c5697351700041c6a2ba2b39107675e04", "ja": "わ、わかった。それで響の気が済むなら、勝負しよう。\n……でも、何で勝負するんだ？", "zh": "我、我知道了。如果这样你就能消气，那就来决胜负吧。\n……但要用什么来决胜负？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "d762568a33dac639daabebd94efd783f65c7d435bc72feec206317f8b43db361", "ja": "えっとね、今から自分のこと、好きなだけホメてみて。\nそれをクールに受け流せたら自分の勝ちね！", "zh": "那个呀，你从现在开始尽情称赞本人看看。\n只要本人能帅气地应对如流，就是本人赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "33d7c50d16a699c812c68f75eac17b7f3d1fa8979944ce1e5cce3a47bcfa06ae", "ja": "自分、今日のライブでクールに決めたばっかりだし。\n何を言われても、今ならクールに反応してみせるぞ！", "zh": "本人才刚在今天的演唱会上表现得很帅气，\n所以现在不管你说什么，本人一定能给出帅气的反应！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "85260d4d19b531e707629d120a624132f38262093d324c52347c122128aec1fa", "ja": "そうか。それなら……。\n今日のライブお疲れ様。いいステージだったよ！", "zh": "是吗？既然这样……\n今天的演唱会辛苦你了，表演很精采喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "528aa4f215733123d97105c56e7be6d8f996e95481a00edd687755ce1d29e4a8", "ja": "そう。ふふん、ありがとう。……だぜ。", "zh": "是吗？哼哼，谢谢你……啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4e52e6d6c11e09029411225aff6ed9f402dace996273f955e8897071d8526ecd", "ja": "語尾はいらないと思うが……演出もばっちり決まってて\n響たちのカッコよさが全面に出たライブだったな。", "zh": "我是觉得不需要加语助词……不过表演效果也非常完美，\n这场演唱会将响你们的帅气表现得淋漓尽致。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "1de74d7e4bf42643a55abee7e3ce303426ad5b6b1c47488f83a1ab8bb89cf4ef", "ja": "あ、でしょでしょ！？　えへへ、自分も今日は……\nじゃ、なくて！　ふ、ふーん。……ふ、ふ～ん。", "zh": "啊，对吧对吧！？嘿嘿，本人也觉得今天……\n不、不对！是、是喔……是、是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "968c768363ab2da58dc74b0878560ff32a6c1b55dd1c85c68d306e9dc358dd5c", "ja": "ファンの反応も上々だし、グッズの売れ行きも過去最高\nだった。まさにカンペキなステージだったな！", "zh": "粉丝的反应十分热烈，周边商品销售量也创新高。\n这场表演简直就是十全十美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "afe2f1781549de76ea5d54fb11f4cec3f963336cb36659a15d02e85127c45b67", "ja": "最高……、う……っ、ダメだ、ダメだぞ自分！\nガマン、ガマンだぞ～。うぐぐぐ……！", "zh": "创新高……唔……不行，不可以喔，本人！\n忍耐，要忍耐喔～唔唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0450d4687dc699e7b31eb508df01e80c343f431ddcf39bb549042af341b3f035", "ja": "（じつにツラそうだな……。よし、そんなに\nこの間のことを気にしてるなら、ここは……）", "zh": "（她好像真的很难受……\n好，既然她这么在意上次的事，那就……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_1022", "source_sha256": "fa6887f83a3d8810f27588a2e05d84b9b8b68e43250d31392951441ea588d80a", "ja": "花をもたせる", "zh": "给响面子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2000_p", "source_sha256": "23a545d1dd411a573cf0c26a7ec56c0dc934b333a896a7fdd0fc8cb4008e207a", "ja": "……はあはあ、降参だ、響。ホメる所が多すぎて、\n選びようがない……。この勝負、響の勝ちだな。", "zh": "……唉，响，我认输了。可以称赞的地方太多，\n我不知道讲哪个好……这场比赛是你赢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2001_013hib", "source_sha256": "06fe9050631406cc10945f6b8318b2a1d226175514b6f285c1b6c0e8c8d67d01", "ja": "え、ホント！？　やったぞ～～！　えへへ、これで自分\nは正真正銘の、クールでカッコイイアイドルだよね！？", "zh": "咦？真的吗！？太棒啦～～！嘿嘿，\n这下子本人就是货真价实的酷帅偶像了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2002_p", "source_sha256": "468011a07101877c4e201d151d95deb5a0479353766045d124ac61921b3304a9", "ja": "もちろん。響のステージにはいつも引き込まれるし、\n間違いない。最高にクールなアイドルだ！", "zh": "当然啰，响的表演总是让人看得入神，\n你毫无疑问是最帅气的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2003_013hib", "source_sha256": "cf12675a41741c3098d9cc11b8b3aea032bd60079999a1fac56aeb7047098b28", "ja": "えへへへっ。そこまで言われると、くすぐったいぞ～。\nでも、ありがとね、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿嘿，你夸成这样，让人有点害羞耶～\n但是，谢谢你了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "ab9739467e67fbd583f759bb954867fa8baa9acc5b6913d5a2a941debe49408f", "ja": "って、あれ？　……うぎゃあああ、しまった～！\n自分、素直に喜んじゃったぞ～！？", "zh": "等等，咦？……呜呀──糟糕～！\n本人刚才直接表现出喜悦了喔～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2005_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2006_013hib", "source_sha256": "682d6c75a595aea53447029c420bc1a01c447a2d23dd13037d8ca2c2d09c7ead", "ja": "うぐぐ～～、まさかこんな引っ掛けを使ってくる\nなんて……。さすがだね、{$P$}！", "zh": "唔唔唔～～想不到你会设下这种陷阱……\n{$P$}，你果然厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2007_013hib", "source_sha256": "351eae21b5706b0fe29b71cf98c7f49aca9612baebe7ca1ce538cd8c3d8f73bb", "ja": "でも、自分はあきらめないぞ！　次までにもっと\n特訓しておくから、覚悟しておいてねっ！！", "zh": "但是，本人不会放弃的！\n下次挑战前本人会做更多特训，你做好心理准备吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0104_2008_p", "source_sha256": "0b72cb4276c3cb8a992b54e7f8d12ac46bafd16888c3ee8bb1629284d6e1de4d", "ja": "（花をもたせるつもりが、押し返されてしまった……。\nでも、元気は出たみたいで何よりだ！）", "zh": "（我本来打算给响面子，她却自己退了回来……\n不过，看她好像有打起精神就好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
